# Admin Panel Rules

## Admin Components
- Main admin interface: [src/components/admin/AdminDashboard.jsx](mdc:src/components/admin/AdminDashboard.jsx)
- Security management: [src/components/admin/AdminSecurity.jsx](mdc:src/components/admin/AdminSecurity.jsx)
- Analytics: [src/components/admin/AdminAnalytics.jsx](mdc:src/components/admin/AdminAnalytics.jsx)
- Content management: [src/components/admin/AdminNews.jsx](mdc:src/components/admin/AdminNews.jsx)

## Admin Features
- User role management (ADMIN, JURY, ORGANIZER, PARTICIPANT, SPECTATOR)
- Content moderation and publishing
- Competition round management
- Analytics and reporting
- System maintenance tools
- Security monitoring

## Security
- Role-based access control
- Audit logging for admin actions
- Input validation and sanitization
- Rate limiting on admin endpoints
- Session management for admin users

## Content Management
- News article creation and editing
- Image upload and management
- Content scheduling and publishing
- Category and tag management
- Featured content selection

## Performance Monitoring
- [src/components/admin/PerformanceMonitor.jsx](mdc:src/components/admin/PerformanceMonitor.jsx)
- Real-time system metrics
- Database performance tracking
- Error monitoring and alerting
- User activity analytics